---
/**
 * Journey chapter 3: the TÜBİTAK high-school research project (2019). The facts are the topics
 * (cryptography, the logic of visual programming) and the flowchart-based tool prototype;
 * the text does not describe features of that prototype beyond them.
 */
import { getLocale } from '../../../i18n/server';

const locale = getLocale(Astro);
---

{
  locale === 'tr' ? (
    <>
      <p>2019’da kriptografi ve görsel programlama mantığı üzerine bir TÜBİTAK lise araştırma projesi yürüttüm.</p>
      <p>
        Projenin bir parçası, akış şemasına dayalı görsel bir kodlama aracının erken bir prototipiydi: Bu araçta
        program, metin olarak yazılmak yerine bir akış şeması olarak kuruluyor.
      </p>
    </>
  ) : (
    <>
      <p>
        In 2019 I carried out a high-school research project with TÜBİTAK, the Scientific and Technological Research
        Council of Türkiye, on cryptography and the logic of visual programming.
      </p>
      <p>
        Part of it was an early prototype of a visual coding tool based on flowcharts: a program is put together by
        drawing its flowchart instead of typing it as text.
      </p>
    </>
  )
}
